1
00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:18,340
你确定我们需要加这么多冰吗  儿子
Are you sure we need that much ice, buddy?

2
00:00:18,620 --> 00:00:20,820
所有美国职篮球员都用冷水浸浴法
All NBA players use cold water immersion therapy.

3
00:00:20,830 --> 00:00:20,950
运动后泡20分钟能缓解肌肉酸痛与疲劳感

4
00:00:20,960 --> 00:00:22,001
来吧
Let's do it.

5
00:00:23,760 --> 00:00:25,600
你说得对  也没那么...
You're right. It's not that b--

6
00:00:26,420 --> 00:00:29,280
一年前的今天  我有机会成为英雄
One year ago today, I had the chance to be a hero.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,280
那是年度高中慈善篮球比赛
It was the annual high school charity basketball game --

8
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:33,321
家长对战老师
parents versus teachers.

9
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:36,610
我们在为出勤率办公室的马丁太太筹钱
We were raising money for Mrs. Martin in the attendance office

10
00:00:36,620 --> 00:00:38,600
泥石流冲垮了她的房子
who lost her house in a mudslide.

11
00:00:39,380 --> 00:00:41,460
房子前一分钟还"出席"  下一分钟就"缺席"了
One minute it was present, the next it was absent.

12
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:44,420
我们落后两分  比赛只剩一秒钟  我来罚球
Down 2, a second left, I was fouled.

13
00:00:44,840 --> 00:00:46,980
胜负就在我手中
The game was in my hands.

14
00:00:50,060 --> 00:00:51,760
在巨大的压力之下  我掉链子了
I crumbled under the pressure.

15
00:00:52,020 --> 00:00:54,010
这赎罪的机会我等了一年
I've waited a year for my shot at redemption

16
00:00:54,020 --> 00:00:56,010
这次我不要留任何弱点
and left nothing to chance.

17
00:00:56,020 --> 00:00:56,961
下手重点
Harder!

18
00:00:57,220 --> 00:00:59,680
我像疯子一样锻炼
I have worked out like a madman --

19
00:01:00,280 --> 00:01:03,150
传球运球训练  敏捷训练
passing and dribbling drills, agility training...

20
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:07,040
最厉害的是  我每天练习100个罚球
...and I top it all off with 100 free throws every day...

21
00:01:09,240 --> 00:01:11,020
无论我那天有多累
...no matter how tired I am.

22
00:01:15,280 --> 00:01:18,640
我经历了一年的痛苦训练  但我已经准备好了
It had been a year of painful training, but I was ready.

23
00:01:33,220 --> 00:01:37,121
我把果汁洒在地毯上了  请别告诉妈妈
I spilled juice on the rug. Please don't tell Mama.

24
00:01:38,020 --> 00:01:38,941
别告诉妈妈
Don't tell Mama?

25
00:01:39,880 --> 00:01:41,081
怎么不说别告诉爸爸
What about "Don't tell Papa?"

26
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:44,200
男孩应该害怕自己的父亲
A boy is supposed to fear his father.

27
00:01:44,500 --> 00:01:46,460
在我爸爸身边  我瑟瑟发抖
I shook in my boots around my old man,

28
00:01:46,480 --> 00:01:47,661
他在他爸爸身边也是如此
just like he did around his.

29
00:01:47,980 --> 00:01:50,850
直到今天  我听见打开施丽兹啤酒的声音
To this day, I hear the crack of a Schlitz

30
00:01:50,860 --> 00:01:53,410
或者闻到辛格尔顿须后水的味道时
or smell some Singleton's Beard Tonic,

31
00:01:53,420 --> 00:01:56,000
都会像小意大利区的黑帮叛徒一样浑身出汗
and I'm sweating like a mob rat in Little Italy.

32
00:02:01,660 --> 00:02:03,181
我绊倒了
Ow! Oh, tripped!

33
00:02:03,790 --> 00:02:04,594
够了
Enough!

34
00:02:05,060 --> 00:02:07,300
要我跟你说多少次你才会捡起你的玩具
How many times have I told you to pick up your toys?

35
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:08,741
你真搞笑
You're funny!

36
00:02:11,754 --> 00:02:12,120
够了  捡起玩具
Enough! Pick up the toys!

37
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:18,381
歌洛莉亚  真是惊喜
Gloria! What a surprise!

38
00:02:19,080 --> 00:02:20,370
曼尼的学校有个妈妈
There's a mom at Manny's school

39
00:02:20,380 --> 00:02:22,280
我跟她不太对盘
that I've had some problems with.

40
00:02:22,460 --> 00:02:25,740
她就是典型的金发傻帽芭比娃娃医生
She's your typical blonde airhead Barbie doll doctor.

41
00:02:26,320 --> 00:02:27,261
你好啊  唐娜
Hola, Donna.

42
00:02:27,920 --> 00:02:29,301
你是不小心逛到这里来了吗
Did you wander in by mistake?

43
00:02:29,420 --> 00:02:30,761
这里可不卖鞋
You know they don't sell shoes here.

44
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:33,440
天啊  你买这么多热狗
Oh, no, I see you buy a lot of hot dogs.

45
00:02:33,660 --> 00:02:36,020
你就这样放弃保持身材真是太惨了
It's so sad when someone just gives up.

46
00:02:36,160 --> 00:02:39,060
我要在高中慈善篮球赛上卖这些
I'm selling these at the high school charity basketball game.

47
00:02:39,320 --> 00:02:40,330
可怜的马丁太太
Poor Mrs. Martin.

48
00:02:40,340 --> 00:02:42,640
今年我们要为她筹钱换肾
This year we're raising money to get her a new kidney

49
00:02:43,020 --> 00:02:44,810
我们能指望你吗
So, can we count on you?

50
00:02:44,820 --> 00:02:45,841
捐肾吗
For the kidney?

51
00:02:46,300 --> 00:02:49,540
写张捐款支票  就跟你以前一样
To write a check, like you always do.

52
00:02:49,550 --> 00:02:49,648
行啊
Yes.

53
00:02:49,660 --> 00:02:52,440
捐钱几乎算得上和做实事一样好呢
Money is almost as good as actually doing something.

54
00:02:54,920 --> 00:02:56,872
房地产拍卖会上40美元买的  你敢信吗
$40 at the estate sale? Can you believe that?

55
00:02:57,015 --> 00:02:58,140
你根本不会发现是拍卖品
Like, there's no way you'd even notice.

56
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:00,341
爸爸  好啊
Dad, hi.

57
00:03:00,720 --> 00:03:01,861
打开12频道
Turn on channel 12.

58
00:03:02,320 --> 00:03:04,190
新闻曝光了一种
It's an expose on cheap lumber

59
00:03:04,200 --> 00:03:06,800
内含致人生病的化学制品的廉价木材
that's got some chemical in it that's making people sick,

60
00:03:06,810 --> 00:03:09,803
"衣柜衣柜衣柜衣柜"公司买了许多
and Closets, Closets, Closets, Closets bought a bunch of it.

61
00:03:10,050 --> 00:03:11,349
瞧瞧  是厄尔的女儿雪莉
Oh, look -- There's Earl's daughter, Shirl.

62
00:03:12,920 --> 00:03:14,409
我们采访了这位
We caught with the local man

63
00:03:14,450 --> 00:03:15,983
与受污染的木材接触之后
who reported flu-like symptoms

64
00:03:16,085 --> 00:03:17,901
出现了类流感症状的当地男子
after contact with the tainted wood.

65
00:03:18,180 --> 00:03:19,257
我只是想给我妻子做一个
I just wanted to give my wife

66
00:03:19,318 --> 00:03:20,760
跟她一样美丽的衣柜
a closet as beautiful as she is.

67
00:03:22,920 --> 00:03:23,912
我们不是买了一些...
Didn't we buy some of --

68
00:03:24,520 --> 00:03:27,190
你能相信厄尔的蠢货女儿
Can you believe Earl's dum-dum daughter

69
00:03:27,200 --> 00:03:28,880
从那些笨蛋手里买了木材吗
bought wood from those bozos?

70
00:03:29,200 --> 00:03:30,770
当然啦  你俩长大时
Of course, when you two were growing up,

71
00:03:30,780 --> 00:03:31,981
她一直都是比较笨的那个
she was always the slow one.

72
00:03:32,400 --> 00:03:34,840
你记得她把那气球当她朋友吗
You remember when she thought that balloon was her friend?

73
00:03:35,760 --> 00:03:36,541
气球达·卡莱尔
Balloon-da Carlisle.

74
00:03:37,640 --> 00:03:39,540
好吧  我继续忙了  爸爸
Right. Well, back to it, Dad.

75
00:03:39,760 --> 00:03:40,322
回头见
See you later.

76
00:03:41,500 --> 00:03:43,990
我就知道那木头这么划算  肯定有鬼
I knew that deal was too good to be true.

77
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:46,094
现在我看起来就要跟一个
And now I'm gonna look as stupid as a girl

78
00:03:46,135 --> 00:03:47,961
把班里的两只兔子都抚摸死的女孩一样蠢了
who pet two different class rabbits to death.

79
00:03:48,780 --> 00:03:50,161
喝点茶吗  先生
A spot of tea, sir?

80
00:03:50,300 --> 00:03:52,140
是上等的我就喝
Only if it's the fancy kind.

81
00:03:52,150 --> 00:03:52,975
我的天
Oh, my God.

82
00:03:52,995 --> 00:03:54,440
我们的英音都变得这么熟练了
How good have our accents gotten?

83
00:03:54,450 --> 00:03:55,281
-太不可思议了  -是啊
- It's insane. - Yeah.

84
00:03:56,040 --> 00:03:59,198
海莉4岁的时候  我们办了第一次茶话会
When Haley was 4, she and I had our first tea party,

85
00:03:59,260 --> 00:04:01,379
从那以后  我们把茶话会变成了传统
and since then, we've made it a tradition

86
00:04:01,420 --> 00:04:02,880
每年都一起喝一次下午茶
to meet for high tea once a year.

87
00:04:03,220 --> 00:04:05,210
我真的很珍惜这些时光
It's a time I've really come to cherish.

88
00:04:05,220 --> 00:04:07,000
我不喜欢他们这个什么茶话会
I don't love the whole tea thing.

89
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:08,850
米奇尔和海莉总是分享秘密
Mitchell and Haley always come back giggling

90
00:04:08,860 --> 00:04:12,181
说说笑笑地回来  我觉得我被排挤在外
over shared secrets, and I feel left out.

91
00:04:12,480 --> 00:04:17,010
我试过自己搞一个舅舅侄女传统活动  但
I once tried to start my own uncle-niece tradition, but...

92
00:04:17,020 --> 00:04:18,434
我不是质疑加速质谱法
I'm not questioning the methodology

93
00:04:18,496 --> 00:04:19,981
背后的方法论
behind accelerated mass spectrometry.

94
00:04:20,180 --> 00:04:22,070
我只是单纯指出不是只有这个方法
I'm merely pointing out that it's not singular

95
00:04:22,080 --> 00:04:23,890
才能够从丰度高的其他同位素中
in its power to separate a rare isotope

96
00:04:23,900 --> 00:04:25,301
分离出稀有的同位素
from an abundant neighboring mass.

97
00:04:26,060 --> 00:04:28,780
你和那个帅气的天气预报员交往得怎么样
What's going on with you and that handsome weatherman?

98
00:04:29,140 --> 00:04:31,114
大部分时候都很好
Things are great, mostly.

99
00:04:31,379 --> 00:04:31,480
挺好的
Yeah.

100
00:04:31,740 --> 00:04:32,951
"大部分时候"
Oh. "mostly"?

101
00:04:32,960 --> 00:04:34,441
遇到什么问题了吗
Well, what's-what's going on?

102
00:04:34,760 --> 00:04:38,810
你能接受你的伴侣
I mean, do you think it's okay for your partner

103
00:04:38,820 --> 00:04:41,240
对你提出的任何要求吗
to ask you to do... anything?

104
00:04:42,020 --> 00:04:44,408
不能  不是任何要求都能接受
Mm, no. Not anything anything.

105
00:04:44,428 --> 00:04:45,795
我们都有个人界限
I mean, we all have our boundaries.

106
00:04:46,162 --> 00:04:47,755
还是有些事是我不会叫小卡去做的
I mean, there are still things I wouldn't ask Cam to do.

107
00:04:47,795 --> 00:04:50,037
好吧  是这样的  某天晚上
Okay. So, um, Rainer and I

108
00:04:50,078 --> 00:04:52,857
雷纳和我躺在床上  然后...
were in bed the other night, and...

109
00:04:52,877 --> 00:04:52,961
然后怎么
And?

110
00:04:53,880 --> 00:04:55,490
他叫我做某件
He asked me to do something

111
00:04:55,531 --> 00:04:57,320
让我有点不舒服的事
I'm not totally comfortable with.

112
00:04:57,400 --> 00:04:58,541
他叫你做什么了
What'd he ask you to do?

113
00:05:01,110 --> 00:05:02,261
我不会评头论足的  你准备好了再说
No-No judgments. Just whenever you're ready.

114
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:04,129
他当时侧躺著
So, he was lying on his side,

115
00:05:04,149 --> 00:05:05,519
他说要以那种体位才能做
and he said that that was part of it,

116
00:05:05,826 --> 00:05:08,510
然后他叫我c...
and then he asked me to c-

117
00:05:08,520 --> 00:05:08,969
海莉
Haley!

118
00:05:10,069 --> 00:05:10,720
他叫你做什么
What'd he ask you to do?

119
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:11,475
快  写在这张餐巾纸上
Quick, write it down on this napkin.

120
00:05:11,965 --> 00:05:13,413
雷纳  你怎么来了
Rainer, what are you doing here?

121
00:05:13,454 --> 00:05:15,104
你把耳机落在我车里了
You left your earbuds in my car.

122
00:05:15,125 --> 00:05:16,601
我知道你喜欢以它们为借口来无视别人
I know you like to use them to ignore people.

123
00:05:18,087 --> 00:05:18,561
你想和我们一起喝茶吗
Do you want to join us?

124
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:20,780
-你不介意吧  米奇舅舅  -怎么会
- You don't mind, do you, Uncle Mitch? - No!

125
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:24,925
回到这里的感觉太奇怪了
It feels weird to be back here.

126
00:05:25,802 --> 00:05:27,291
我曾败在这间体育馆里
This gym got the better of me once.

127
00:05:27,332 --> 00:05:29,461
爸  你又要把自己逼疯了
Dad, you're psyching yourself out.

128
00:05:29,769 --> 00:05:30,181
你说得对
You're right.

129
00:05:30,420 --> 00:05:32,250
今年与去年唯一的区别
The only thing different between this year and last

130
00:05:32,260 --> 00:05:34,420
是今年我有备而来
is I'm prepared this year.

131
00:05:34,820 --> 00:05:37,741
德安德鲁·乔丹和查尔斯·巴克利也来了
And DeAndre Jordan and Charles Barkley are here.

132
00:05:38,985 --> 00:05:40,121
是在这里盖已买票的章吗
Is this where we get our hand stamped?

133
00:05:40,520 --> 00:05:42,600
有时候我喜欢去别的地方逛逛再回来
Sometimes I like to leave and come back to things.

134
00:05:42,860 --> 00:05:45,096
你们怎么来了
Uh, why-why are you here?

135
00:05:45,422 --> 00:05:47,868
我们经纪人的妻子是这所学校的数学老师
Our agent's wife is a math teacher at the school.

136
00:05:47,889 --> 00:05:48,500
咱去占座吧
Let's go get our seats.

137
00:05:48,640 --> 00:05:49,901
我们不想被人们挡住视线
We don't want anybody to block us.

138
00:05:50,300 --> 00:05:52,200
是啊  我懂
Yeah, yeah. I-I get that.

139
00:05:54,035 --> 00:05:55,436
所以我得在大牌职篮球星面前打球吗
So, I'm playing in front of two NBA stars?

140
00:05:55,845 --> 00:05:57,030
还有  一旦人们听说他们在这
Plus, once people know they're here,

141
00:05:57,479 --> 00:05:59,540
围观群众肯定会比去年多五倍
the crowd will be like five times the size it was last year.

142
00:05:59,561 --> 00:06:01,215
消防局长不会让这么多人挤在馆里的
Well, we still live in a world with a fire marshal.

143
00:06:02,195 --> 00:06:02,450
等等
Wait.

144
00:06:02,460 --> 00:06:03,848
没准他们只是来露个脸
They're probably just here to show their faces

145
00:06:03,909 --> 00:06:06,498
站个台就走了
and make a quick exit...

146
00:06:06,518 --> 00:06:07,783
爸  别被他们影响
Dad, don't let them faze you.

147
00:06:08,070 --> 00:06:09,090
你为此艰苦训练过
This is what you've trained for.

148
00:06:09,640 --> 00:06:10,515
你准备好了
You're ready.

149
00:06:10,535 --> 00:06:10,840
你说得对
You're right.

150
00:06:11,649 --> 00:06:13,051
我只要放松一下就好了
I just need to shake the jitters off a little bit.

151
00:06:14,009 --> 00:06:14,660
交给我  拉里
I got you, Larry.

152
00:06:15,378 --> 00:06:16,694
定点跳投
Spot up.

153
00:06:17,800 --> 00:06:18,074
不
No!

154
00:06:18,095 --> 00:06:20,221
歌洛莉亚  真的是你吗
Gloria? Is that you?

155
00:06:20,840 --> 00:06:24,071
我的大脑不能接受你出现在此情此景里
My brain's having a hard time processing you in this context.

156
00:06:24,376 --> 00:06:27,080
我来卖玉米片筹善款
Yeah, I came to sell my nachos to raise money.

157
00:06:27,360 --> 00:06:28,381
你人真好
How nice.

158
00:06:28,960 --> 00:06:31,348
尽管有人说你的努力来得太迟太少
Although, some people are saying it's too little too late,

159
00:06:31,797 --> 00:06:34,201
你不能来露个脸就指望能记上一功
that you can't just show up and get credit for it.

160
00:06:34,540 --> 00:06:35,579
我觉得这些话很刻薄
I think it's mean,

161
00:06:35,640 --> 00:06:38,108
但有些人说你看起来有点虚伪
but some people are saying it seems disingenuous.

162
00:06:38,537 --> 00:06:39,209
我刚到这
I just got here.

163
00:06:39,230 --> 00:06:40,880
你是什么时候听这些人说这些话的
When did you talk to all these people?

164
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:42,550
我认为你会发现这些人
I think you'll find this crowd

165
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:43,947
不宣[喜欢]玉米片
no lika da nachos.

166
00:06:44,313 --> 00:06:45,970
如果你觉得学口音很种族歧视  我感到抱歉
I'm sorry if that sounds racist.

167
00:06:45,990 --> 00:06:46,440
才没有呢
No, it didn't.

168
00:06:46,500 --> 00:06:49,497
我根本就没听出你在取笑哪种语言
I don't even know what language you were trying to make fun of.

169
00:06:49,538 --> 00:06:53,113
既然你不打算走  你可以在那支个摊
Okay, since you're not leaving, you can set up down there.

170
00:06:54,260 --> 00:06:54,667
不
No.

171
00:06:55,093 --> 00:06:57,619
那好黑  还很偏
It's very dark, and it's very far away!

172
00:06:57,823 --> 00:06:58,640
祝你好运
